        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-04-AT, Decorative Beaded Colonial Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 8 finishes so that you can choose the perfect match for your existing decor, RK International's Colonial Beaded Cabinet Pull has a traditional style that is both beautiful and timeless. A true classic, this cabinet door pull will surely stand out for years to come because elegance is something that will never really go out of style. It has a 3 inch center to center. Comes packaged with the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-04-AT Decorative Elongated Colonial Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
